WEBVTT

00:00:00.752 --> 00:00:13.202
The Upcoming tab is the first thing you see when you open the app: the next events of Formando Congo, each with a countdown. The dot at the top is green when you are online, red when you are offline, and orange while the app updates.

00:00:13.704 --> 00:00:18.184
Tap an event to open it. You see the dates, the place and the full programme.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:25.605
Starting five days before an event, you also see the weather forecast for that city: the temperature and the chance of rain.

00:00:26.105 --> 00:00:33.435
Descriptions written in another language are translated into yours automatically. Tap the orange note to see the original text.

00:00:33.936 --> 00:00:42.096
If the administrators put a flyer or an Instagram post in the description, you see it right here. Tap a picture to open it full size.

00:00:42.598 --> 00:00:47.618
Use the buttons at the bottom to add the event to your own calendar, or to open the place in Maps.

00:00:48.118 --> 00:00:56.338
Going? Tap I'm going. The administrators then see your name in their list. Plans changed? Tap again to undo.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:08.410
When an an administrator drives, you see the car, the free seats, and where and when it leaves. Tap Reserve a seat. It's first come, first served, and you can always give your seat back.

00:01:08.911 --> 00:01:13.701
Back in the list, the events you're going to stand out in orange, so you never miss one.

00:01:14.202 --> 00:01:20.112
Members also have an I'm going tab: all the upcoming events you joined, with their chats, in one place.

